silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_07_yoneda_profile_drill_sections_04_naturality_in_two_variables_concrete_anchor#colimitfactorizationarrow_vetcareplan silm:hasLongDescription "The ColimitFactorizationArrow_VetCarePlan is ColimitFactorizationArrow_VetCarePlan: the concrete arrow g: MittensColimitApex -> VetCarePlan_77 (the unique factorization); used to exhibit the A-naturality square of the Yoneda bijection. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'g (morphism varying A)', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
