silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_07_yoneda_profile_drill_sections_04_naturality_in_two_variables_concrete_anchor#alphanattrans_clinicaltogrooming silm:hasLongDescription "The AlphaNatTrans_ClinicalToGrooming is AlphaNatTrans_ClinicalToGrooming: the natural transformation alpha: ClinicalLabelPresheaf -> GroomingLabelPresheaf that maps clinical record labels to grooming log labels; used to exhibit the F-naturality square of the Yoneda bijection." .
