silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_07_yoneda_profile_drill_sections_04_naturality_in_two_variables_concrete_anchor#groominglabelpresheaf silm:hasLongDescription "The GroomingLabelPresheaf is GroomingLabelPresheaf: the concrete second presheaf G used in the F-naturality square; assigns to each D_Mittens source node X the set of grooming log labels recorded for X in GroomingLog_42. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'G (second presheaf for F-naturality)', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
